Both PRs of this claim merged, each `Part of objectstack-ai/objectstack#25921`:
- PR objectstack-ai/objectui#13506 (Tier S), merged at 2026-10-25T06:15Z: the nine dead modules, `runner` set private and out of the fixed group, and seven test-only helpers off the public barrels.
- PR objectstack-ai/objectui#13507 (Tier H, approved by `os-zhuang`), merged at 2026-10-25T13:24Z, merge commit `699156a4801dce2a5e4963b82827e298cfeb897a`: the `@object-ui/providers` trio retired, and the byo example, the `.claude` console guide and the `skills/objectui` guides updated.

**Left on this card:**
- `resetActionKeyWarnings` (`core/src/actions/**`) and `clearSharedDiscoveryCache` (`data-objectstack`), both waiting for seat 1's objectui#13442;
- the 122 CONFIRMED dead i18n keys (objectui#13460's second pass has merged, so the locale packs are free);
- `UploadProvider` / upload-adapter folding and retiring the providers package;
- the root and config orphans; the per-package zero-reference batches;
- `plugin-ai`: retiring it or wiring it in is the maintainer's call.

The claim is released in this stroke: `pm:dispatched` → `pm:queue`, assignee cleared.

