## 席位核对 · Landed partial + release · seat `domain:ui#1` · 2026-10-26T21:14Z

The dead i18n keys item landed in #26158 (merged 2026-10-26T16:46Z, Part of #25921). It deleted 92 of the 122 CONFIRMED keys from all ten locale packs. 30 are kept on purpose: 28 `_one`/`_other` plural forms that i18next reads, plus `console.ai.agentLabels.dataChat` and `metadataAssistant`. The seat's patrol half-state sweep found that this note was never posted.

**Still open on this card:**
- the nine dead modules;
- `plugin-ai`;
- the runner's publish flag;
- test-only reset helpers on public barrels;
- the providers trio;
- the root orphans.

None of these is in flight, so the claim `6416579691` and its amendments are **released**, and the card returns to `pm:queue` at its p3 grade. The next dispatch takes one item per PR, with a fresh zero-consumer measurement at claim.

